      "name": "atoms.ts",
      "filePath": "src/store/repo/atoms.ts",
      "summary": "Defines core and persisted Jotai atoms for repo state: the core repo list, window-scoped selected repo/branch atoms backed by sessionStorage with a localStorage global fallback, branch data/cache atoms, and loading/error/freshness tracking atoms.",
