      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "Uses a custom Jotai storage adapter for selectedRepoIdAtom that reads from sessionStorage but falls back to a global lastUsedRepo key in localStorage, enabling per-window repo isolation while surviving Tauri webview restarts."
    },
